      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[0].Bodies.Array.data[0]'
      value: What we can learn from our feathered friends
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[1].Bodies.Array.data[0]'
      value: REDACTED
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[2].Bodies.Array.data[0]'
      value: We spent our life running from them, hiding from them, out smarting
        and out-manuvering them. But what if we could harness the power of calamaties
        to alieveate our dependance on this money's paw.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[3].Bodies.Array.data[0]'
      value: From heaters strong enough to warm the globe to high speed trolley,
        here are all the most innovative caelestium inventions made!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[4].Bodies.Array.data[0]'
      value: In this book we present the classic trolley problem in many unique ways.
        1 person, 5 people, Count Ester, twenty pigeons, and more!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[5].Bodies.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'From the beginning of history, humanity has counted from 1. But what
        is we counted from 4, from 23984 or in 29384? '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[6].Bodies.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'An in depth investigation of the potential uses of basic chemicals,
        and new compounds that may come from them. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[7].Bodies.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'Quakes are caused by moving tectonic plates. Here I investigation the
        potential to use Caelestium to re-enforce and control this massive system. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
