    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[0].Bodies.Array.data[0]'
      value: Dearest Amaia,
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[0].Bodies.Array.data[1]'
      value: It turns out you were right. I went too far. And now, he's gone. I'm
        sorry. I never listened, and I never will. One day maybe someone wise will
        make the kinder choice.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[0].Bodies.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'Why, though. Why does it have to be me who decides. Why did you have
        to leave. You should have told me, you could have stopped me, I. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[0].Bodies.Array.data[3]'
      value: I've made my choice. They never listen to me, and I don't have any other
        way. I wish you were still here, they always liked you. Always liked him.
        Anyway. Goodbye.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[0].Bodies.Array.data[4]'
      value: With may regrets, ------ -----
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
