      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Lore.Array.data[1].Counter
      value: b3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Lore.Array.data[2].Counter
      value: b3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Lore.Array.data[0].Subtitle
      value: 'Chapter 1: Darkness'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Lore.Array.data[1].Subtitle
      value: 'Chapter 2: The Long Night'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Lore.Array.data[2].Subtitle
      value: 'Chapter 3: The Rebellion'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Lore.Array.data[2].Bodies.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[0].Bodies.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'The Tower of Chiaroscuro is one of 20 emergency sites build by the
        Dragons. Chiaroscuro was the first of the towers, formerly an international
        research body, which led the charge in mitigating the calamities of Skyfall.
        The tower is also the center of operations for the ''World Shield,'' a project
        run to protect a large amount of land from Skyfall. Within Chiaroscuro, the
        Dragons aimed to create a society to recclaim the land once the calamities
        were dealt with. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[1].Bodies.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'The first years after the World Shield rose were marked by turmoil.
        The shield technically made the land safe once more. However, the number
        of rescued persons far exceeded the reasources available. After the ''World
        Shield'', light, food and water all became premium resources. Within the
        first 5 years, there was notable discontent with the allocation of resources.
        Most notably, there were many who wished to leave the tower and do their
        best to survive Skyfall outside. However, those who left often wanted resources
        to take with them, and often sought to return later on. This was a point
        of contension, especially with rapidly dwindling supplies. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3904203509725669748, guid: a3d8974cfdc93d8418cedce593de086e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Lore.Array.data[2].Bodies.Array.data[0]'
      value: Those who wished to leave often couldn't survive without some source
        of light. Except for the sources at the towers, darkness blanketed the land.
        Even if one left, the journey to the next tower over was near impossible
        without some sort of vehicle, and all the vehicles from before required Caelestium.
        Therefore, in 5AD, many of the tower occupants attempted to rise against
        the Dark Dragon, who currently controlled the light. In the ensuing class,
        the Light Dragon disappeared, and may of the populance was exiled from the
        tower entirely.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
